1
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:08,133
Your organization may not have an opportunity problem. It may have a visibility problem.

2
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:13,600
The funders, the partners, the public programs, the community resources —

3
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,500
most of it is already out there.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:19,933
But it lives in forty browser tabs, six spreadsheets, and somebody's inbox.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,333
And when you can't see how it all connects, every decision gets harder than it should be.

6
00:00:27,433 --> 00:00:30,333
Anansi Atlas brings the whole ecosystem into view —

7
00:00:30,333 --> 00:00:33,767
one connected map of the opportunity web around your mission.

8
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:39,700
Watch what happens when scattered research becomes structure. Funding pathways.

9
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:43,933
Strategic partners. Government programs. An honest read on your readiness.

10
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,100
Complexity in. Clarity out. And a practical plan for what to do next.

11
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:56,567
The opportunity may already exist. Anansi Atlas helps you see how it connects.
